Cell["\<\
The first three of the maximal sets at scale 2 on the 9 x 9 grid: the \
straight cross, then two crosses that turn at the centre.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"330ef5f8-70b2-4b11-bf67-b731b663cfe4"],

